### Criar psicologo

POST http://localhost:3000/api/psicologo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "especialidade": "Psicologia clínica",
  "numero_ordem": "01010101111",
  "nbi":"00990200LA045",
  "user": {
      "email": "lura@example.com",
      "password": "User123_",
      "nome": "Lura",
      "sobrenome": "Nunes"
  }
}

